{{!
    @template tool_vae/situation_pieces

    The pieces of a situation: a heading, then the sentence that there is none, or one line per piece - its nature, its
    title for whoever may open it, the part concerned, its size and date, "removed" or the way to open it (the whole address,
    its host and the link that opens a new tab; or the file), and the buttons of the vaeiste.

    Every text comes from the context, already worded by tool_vae\output\situation_pieces. The template holds no logic.
    Every value is escaped (double braces) except one key:
    * actionshtml - the buttons "detach" and "remove", drawn by the renderer of the core ('' for a reader)

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * none

    Context variables required for this template:
    * heading - string
    * none - object or null: text
    * items - array: nature; title (object: text) or null; part (object: label, text) or null; details; removed (object:
      text) or null; link (object: url, host, open) or null; file (object: url, open) or null; actionshtml

    Example context (json):
    {
        "heading": "Pieces of the situation",
        "none": null,
        "items": [
            {
                "nature": "Professional writing", "title": {"text": "Protocol"},
                "part": {"label": "Part concerned", "text": "The beginning"}, "details": "9 November 2026, 04:23",
                "removed": null,
                "link": {"url": "https://example.org/a", "host": "example.org", "open": "Open the link"},
                "file": null, "actionshtml": ""
            },
            {
                "nature": "Contract", "title": null, "part": null, "details": "PDF, 12 KB - 9 November 2026, 04:23",
                "removed": null, "link": null,
                "file": {"url": "https://example.com/pluginfile.php/5/tool_vae/spiece/2/a.pdf", "open": "Open the file"},
                "actionshtml": ""
            }
        ]
    }
}}
<h3 class="h5 mt-4">{{heading}}</h3>{{#none}}<p class="text-muted">{{text}}</p>{{/none}}{{!
}}{{^none}}<ul class="list-unstyled tool-vae-pieces">{{#items}}<li class="mb-3 tool-vae-piece"><strong>{{nature}}</strong>{{!
}}{{#title}} - {{text}}{{/title}}{{!
}}{{#part}}<div class="small"><span class="text-muted me-2">{{label}}</span>{{text}}</div>{{/part}}{{!
}}<div class="text-muted small">{{details}}</div>{{!
}}{{#removed}}<div class="text-muted">{{text}}</div>{{/removed}}{{!
}}{{#link}}<div>{{url}}</div><div class="text-muted small">{{host}}</div>{{!
}}<div><a href="{{url}}" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">{{open}}</a></div>{{/link}}{{!
}}{{#file}}<div><a href="{{url}}">{{open}}</a></div>{{/file}}{{!
}}{{{actionshtml}}}</li>{{/items}}</ul>{{/none}}
